msgid "CombinedAction"
msgstr "Kombinerad Action"

#: source/blender/editors/armature/pose_transform.cc:425
msgid ""
"Actions on this armature will be destroyed by this new rest pose as the "
"transforms stored are relative to the old rest pose"
msgstr ""
"Actioner på den här armaturen förstörs av den nya viloposen eftersom de "
"lagrade transformeringarna är relativa till den gamla viloposen"

#: source/blender/editors/asset/intern/asset_ops.cc:106
msgid ""
"Data-block does not support asset operations - must be a Brush, Collection, "
"Node Group, Object, Pose Action, Scene, or World"
msgstr ""
"Datablocket stöder inte resursåtgärder. Det måste vara en pensel, samling, "
"nodgrupp, objekt, pose-Action, scen eller värld"

#: source/blender/editors/asset/intern/asset_ops.cc:109
msgid ""
"No data-block selected that supports asset operations - select at least one "
"Brush, Collection, Node Group, Object, Pose Action, Scene, or World"
msgstr ""
"Inget valt datablock stöder resursåtgärder. Välj minst en pensel, samling, "
"nodgrupp, objekt, pose-Action, scen eller värld"

#: source/blender/editors/interface/templates/interface_template_id.cc:877
msgid "Browse Action to be linked"
msgstr "Bläddra efter Action som ska länkas"

#: source/blender/editors/render/render_preview.cc:978
msgid "No active object, unable to apply the Action before rendering"
msgstr "Inget aktivt objekt. Det går inte att tillämpa Actionen före rendering"

#: source/blender/editors/render/render_preview.cc:992
msgid "Action has no data, cannot render preview"
msgstr "Actionen har inga data, kan inte visa förhandsgranskning"

#: source/blender/editors/render/render_preview.cc:982
msgid "Object %s has no pose, unable to apply the Action before rendering"
msgstr "Objektet %s har ingen pose. Det går inte att tillämpa Actionen före rendering"

#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:361
#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:468
msgid "Action+Slot has already been stashed"
msgstr "Action och Action-slot har redan lagrats"

#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:365
msgid "Could not unassign the active Action"
msgstr "Det gick inte att ta bort tilldelningen av den aktiva Actionen"

#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:449
#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:462
msgid "Could not assign a new Action to %s"
msgstr "Det gick inte att tilldela en ny Action till %s"

#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:470
msgid "Could not un-assign Action from %s"
msgstr "Det gick inte att ta bort tilldelningen av Action från %s"

#: source/blender/editors/space_action/action_data.cc:523
msgid ""
"Action '%s' will not be saved, create Fake User or Stash in NLA Stack to "
"retain"
msgstr ""
"Actionen ”%s” sparas inte. Skapa en fejkanvändare eller lagra den i NLA-"
"stapeln för att behålla den"

